es_ES: 2 changes by SilverSurferZzZ
fr_FR: 51 changes by arikover
it_IT: 2 changes by Voyager1
nl_NL: 2 changes by foobar


0.7.0 - 2015/09/22
- Feature: American Road Replacement Set support (zooks) (closes #6101)
- Feature: direction sign (closes #3829)
- Feature: hard shoulder with emergency telephone (closes #3513)
- Feature: hard shoulder with variable message sign
- Feature: have shoulder end pieces recognize many more other objects (closes #3574)
- Feature: Indonesian translation (SkiddLow)
- Feature: introduction dates in object description
- Feature: left hand drive support for railroad crossing signs
- Feature: median with streetlights (closes #3572)
- Feature: parameter to disable introduction dates of objects
- Feature: railroad crossing signs
- Feature: warning signs
- Change: colours in purchase description
- Change: rename "introduced" to "designed" to match vehicle purchase menu
- Change: require OpenTTD r23842 (closes #3573)
- Change: review text strings
- Update: Translations
ca_ES: 74 changes by juanjo
es_ES: 51 changes by SilverSurferZzZ
fi_FI: 1 change by alluke
fi_FI: 76 changes by Arexander
fr_FR: 78 changes by arikover
hr_HR: 122 changes by Voyager1
it_IT: 66 changes by Snail
it_IT: 71 changes by Voyager1
ko_KR: 71 changes by Telk
lb_LU: 75 changes by Phreeze
nl_NL: 49 changes by foobar

0.6.0 - 2012/01/19
- Feature: additional activators for matrix signs
- Feature: end piece for hard shoulders
- Feature: median end pieces
- Feature: maximum speed sign
- Feature: motorway end sign
- Feature: motorway sign
- Feature: one way no entry sign
- Feature: one way sign
- Feature: yield sign
- Feature: motorway start/end signs on shoulder start/end pieces
- Feature: split objects into multiple categories
- Fix: don't allow foundations next to shoulders
- Fix: don't require median tiles to continue one additional tile in order to get a corner
- Fix: disable object for other drive side

0.5.1 - 2012/01/08
- Feature: also allow standalone motorway signs on upward slopes
- Feature: UK road support for standalone motorway signs

0.5.0 - 2012/01/07
- Feature: disable roadside trees and streetlights by default (parameter to enable)
- Feature: gantry one shade darker and no middle support
- Feature: guardrails for medians
- Feature: ingame url and check to disallow in TTDPatch
- Feature: left hand drive support
- Feature: matrix signs (sign graphics by RL Conroy)
- Feature: UK Roads support (graphics by Leanden)
- Fix: rework gantry slope check
- Fix: shoulder bends
- Change: denote authors in graphics files

0.4.0 - 2011/09/13
- Feature: motorway direction signs
- Feature: motorway direction gantries
- Feature: allow overbuilding hard shoulders and medians
- Fix: introduction date for hard shoulders and medians
- Fix: improved fingerpost graphics to remove hover effect
- Change: reworked strings

0.3.0 - 2011/09/09
- Feature: motorway medians with third lane

0.2.1 - 2011/09/07
- Fix: hard shoulder inside and outside corners couldn't connect directly
- Fix: improve graphics of east/west inside hard shoulder corners

0.2.0 - 2011/09/07
- Feature: hard shoulders

0.1.0 - 2011/08/19
- Feature: historic, classic and modern fingerposts for 1, 2, 3 and 4 directions
